<title>JAPAN: Toyota says to buy cylinder liners from Dana in US.</title>
<headline>Toyota says to buy cylinder liners from Dana in US.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Monday it will start procuring cylinder liners from U.S. vehicle components maker Dana Corp this month.</p>
<p>A Toyota spokesman said it plans to procure one million of the liners per year from Dana for use in cars produced at its U.S. unit, Toyota Motor Manufacturing Kentucky Inc.</p>
<p>He said Toyota already procures engine blocks in the United States from General Motors Corp (GM).</p>
</text>
